MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Hur_Arena_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Hur_Arena_m01_001: The match is on {SetColor=Gold}{DateTime=Month} {DateTime=Day}{SetColor=Default}. Please, come\nwhen it's time!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Hur_Arena_m01_002: I still can't believe that Aurora's son showed up out\nof nowhere to register for the games...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Hur_Arena_m01_003: I thought it was a joke. It's so strange how people can\nmeet each other, isn't it?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Hur_Arena_m01_004: I mean, I'm still keeping it a secret from Aurora that\nyou're participating in the Heroic Games.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Hur_Arena_m01_005: I'll have to explain it to her sometime...\nJust not now.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c04_Hur_Arena_m01: <BLN>So strange how people meet...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Hur_Arena_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Hur_Arena_m02_001: Your match is today. Are you ready to fight?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Hur_Arena_m02_002: I still can't believe that Aurora's son showed up out\nof nowhere to register for the games...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Hur_Arena_m02_003: I thought it was a joke. It's so strange how people can\nmeet each other, isn't it?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Hur_Arena_m02_004: I mean, I'm still keeping it a secret from Aurora that\nyou're participating in the Heroic Games.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Hur_Arena_m02_005: I'll have to explain it to her sometime...\nJust not now.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c04_Hur_Arena_m02: <BLN>Today's match day.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Aur_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Aur_m01_001: Cai! How are you? Have you gotten used to life in\nDagsion yet?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Aur_m01_002: I just ask that you don't get involved in anything\ndangerous, OK?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Aur_m01_003: What?! You met with Castor in his cell?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Aur_m01_004: How did you manage that? I thought only officials\nwere allowed in there.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Aur_m01_005: Are you sure you're supposed to be down there?\nYou aren't doing anything wrong, I hope.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Aur_m01_006: I do so worry that you might get in trouble.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Aur_m01_007: Listen to me. I've fallen into my old habit of\nworrying too much.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c04_Aur_m01: <BLN>Don't do anything dangerous!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Tia_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Tia_m01_001: The White-Maned Demon fought a special match,\nbut it doesn't mean he'll appear in the Heroic Games.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Tia_m01_002: I'm simply saying we won't necessarily have to\nfight him.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c04_Tia_m01: <BLN>I don't want to fight him...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Pet_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Pet_m01_001: *sigh* Every time I think about the Heroic Games,\nI get more worried.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Pet_m01_002: Are we going to be OK? Are we really?
MID_LGA_1KAI_c04_Pet_m01: <BLN>How am I feeling?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Tia_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Tia_m02_001: It's so exciting to be taking part in something as big\nas the Heroic Games.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Tia_m02_002: There aren't many days between now and the\nqualifiers. We need to get prepared.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c04_Tia_m02: <BLN>We should prepare.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Pet_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Pet_m02_001: It's almost time for the qualifiers. Urgh... I hate being\nso anxious.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Pet_m02_002: There's got to be some way I could get my confidence\nup before the match. Probably? I hope?
MID_LGA_1KAI_c04_Pet_m02: <BLN>Urgh... So anxious...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Cas_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Cas_m01_001: You're here again? If you've got so much free time,\nyou ought to be training.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Cas_m01_002: Take your weapon in hand, every day, without fail.\nTraining regularly can make all the difference.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c04_Cas_m01: <BLN>What are you doing here?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Cen_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Cen_m01_001: Have you had the opportunity to become acquainted\nwith the city?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Cen_m01_002: It's been close to 14 hundred years since construction\nbegan on Dagsion.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Cen_m01_003: Explore the city during your stay. There's much to\nlearn here.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_Cen_m01_004: But stay wary. There are troublesome folk about,\nso I ask that you take the utmost care.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c04_Cen_m01: <BLN>It's been nearly 14 hundred years...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_B01_m01_001: The Heroic Games are underway at last! Who do you\nthink will win?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c04_B01_m01_002: I still say the queen of Saramis is the most likely to\nwin the whole contest.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c04_B01_m01: <BLN>It's started!